Qualify upstream's theme Color singleton for Qt 6.12.

QtQuick 6.12 exports a `Color` singleton (QQuickColor), and it shadows the
unqualified qs.Commons Color: every palette role reads undefined and the bar,
menus, OSD, polkit and lock draw black. This imports `qs.Commons as Upstream`
and writes `Upstream.Color` wherever upstream uses the palette.

From omacom/mobile 0a26f62
(packages/omarchy-config/0001-qualify-theme-color.patch), MIT, (c) 2026
Omacom. Same upstream pin (c668141, v4.0.4). Rebased onto port-4x.patch and
notification-popups-bar-opt-out.patch (no offsets); the hunks are omacom's.

